20260523114856 x x x x Root Cause Analysis The tests stopped executing successfully due to a hard compiler limitation in Lua: a single block/function (including a top-level file chunk) cannot have more than 200 local variables. During the recent commit under ZID 20260523113126, three new helper functions were added at the top level of main.lua: get_dw_drag_threshold_px get_dw_mouse_auto_scroll_interval dw_pointer_exceeded_drag_threshold This pushed the total number of top-level local variables and function declarations in main.lua past the limit of 200. Consequently, when mpv tried to spin up for any acceptance test, the script failed to load entirely, producing the following compiler error in mpv_last_run.log: Lua error: scripts/kardenwort/main.lua:9514: main function has more than 200 local variables Because the script crashed during load, the IPC connection could not be established, leading to immediate test failures or hangs across the entire suite. Solution To resolve this issue and provide safety margin (headroom) for future features, we made several top-level utility and mouse-drag functions global inside the script's environment by removing the local keyword: safe_read_file is_valid_mpv_key expand_ru_keys validate_config get_dw_drag_threshold_px get_dw_mouse_auto_scroll_interval dw_pointer_exceeded_drag_threshold In mpv, each script runs in an isolated Lua interpreter state, so making these functions global is completely safe, does not leak to other scripts, and immediately frees up local variable slots. Verification Results We verified the fix by running the foundational acceptance tests again: powershell python -m pytest tests/acceptance/test_20260309002123_v1_0_0_foundation.py -v The compiler error is resolved, the IPC connections successfully established, and all tests in the foundational suite now pass: tests/acceptance/test_20260309002123_v1_0_0_foundation.py::TestMarchEarlyRegressions::test_20260309002123_v1_0_0_foundation PASSED [ 20%] tests/acceptance/test_20260309002123_v1_0_0_foundation.py::TestMarchEarlyRegressions::test_20260310002147_v1_2_0_centralization PASSED [ 40%] tests/acceptance/test_20260309002123_v1_0_0_foundation.py::TestMarchEarlyRegressions::test_20260312192633_v1_25_0_fuzzy_search PASSED [ 60%] tests/acceptance/test_20260309002123_v1_0_0_foundation.py::TestMarchEarlyRegressions::test_20260314000819_v1_26_8_validation_with_subs PASSED [ 80%] tests/acceptance/test_20260309002123_v1_0_0_foundation.py::TestMarchEarlyRegressions::test_20260314000819_v1_26_8_ass_gatekeeping PASSED [100%] ============================= 5 passed in 14.83s ==============================
